{"id":"indienne","lemma":"indienne","pos":"noun","rank":4352,"glosses":["printed calico","overarm sidestroke"],"ipa":"/ɛ̃.djɛn/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"indiennes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-Indienne.wav","examples":[{"text":"J'aime la cuisine indienne.","en":"I like Indian food.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"kitchen"},null]},{"text":"Les élèves marchèrent en file indienne.","en":"The students walked in a single file.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"to raise","l":"élever"},{"g":"to walk","l":"marcher"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to spin","l":"filer"},null]},{"text":"Mettez-vous en rang en file indienne.","en":"Line up in single file.","words":[{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"you"},null,null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to spin","l":"filer"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"in a row"]]},{"text":"La cuisine taïwanaise est moins épicée que la cuisine indienne.","en":"Taiwanese food is milder than Indian food.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"kitchen"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"less"},{"g":"hot, spicy","l":"épicé"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"kitchen"},null]},{"text":"On l'a suivi en file indienne jusqu'à la cabane.","en":"We followed him single file till we reached the cabin.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"following"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to spin","l":"filer"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"cabin, hut, shack"}],"phrases":[[8,10,"a la"]]}]}